;; Seatbelt profile for M8. Everything is permitted except the network.
;;
;; The suite needs the filesystem (it builds fixture trees in TMPDIR) and needs
;; to spawn `security` for the keychain, so this denies exactly one thing and
;; leaves the rest alone. A narrower profile would fail for reasons unrelated to
;; the claim being tested, which would make the witness useless.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network*)
